title: "spiral-emergence: negative-control ledger pipeline"
abstract: "Python implementation of a negative-control ledger for multi-stage numerical pipelines, demonstrated on a critical Ising chain and MERA tensor networks. Includes guard registry, audit tables, reproducibility guards, and runtime completeness checks. Companion code to the manuscript 'A negative-control ledger for multi-stage numerical pipelines — demonstrated on Ising/MERA'."
